      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَابِلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبْلٌ</span>, last sentence. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَابِلَتِى عَبُولُ</span></b> 
is a saying of the Arabs like their saying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاجِنَتِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجُونُ</span> [i. e., app., meaning <i>My separater</i> from
